'''Nord Axe''' is the seventh, [[Deep North]]-tier one-handed [[Axes|axe]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is a slow but powerful overhead swing, ''perfect'' for removing tree stumps that are too low to hit with a normal swing.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Axe]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Axe''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* From [[Loot chest#Granary Barrel|Granary Barrel]]s in [[Abandoned Village]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrading ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Axe can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Axe}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Axe}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Axe will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

